--- !u!114 &1487436254
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1487436252}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 0.97, b: 0.92, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 42
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: '<size=70><b>HOW TO PLAY</b></size>


    <b><color=#FFD86B>PICK UP</color></b>  
    Put your hand on a thing and HOLD the

    <b>GRIP</b> button (side of the controller,
    under your

    middle finger). Let go to drop it. Not the trigger.


    <b><color=#FFD86B>SWORD</color></b>  
    On the stone block. Take it by the handle;

    it keeps the angle your hand
    had when you gripped.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>OTHER WEAPONS</color></b>   On the
    wooden table to your left.

    Grab them anywhere.


    <b><color=#FFD86B>FIGHT</color></b>  
    Swing at the straw dummy. Harder swings

    flash brighter and sound louder.
    Nothing is scripted:

    it reacts to the real hit.


    <b><color=#FFD86B>MOVE</color></b>  
    Left stick. Click it to run.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>TURN</color></b>   Right
    stick left or right.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>CROUCH / JUMP</color></b>   Right
    stick down / click it.

    <b><color=#FFD86B>MENU</color></b>   Y button: comfort,
    teleport, turning.'
